      "<strong>v1.14 &mdash; /app/refill/promos ported from openagenticv4 (P0 audit fix, ship 3 of the port sprint).</strong> Per <code>Agentiport-Port-Audit.html</code>, this was flagged as the possible &lsquo;amazing dashboard&rsquo; Grasshopper remembered: manufacturer promotions surface where the spa owner sees promos for manufacturers she actually carries (matched at claim-your-business via <code>service.attachments.matchedProduct.manufacturer</code>), with Express Interest / Dismiss actions that signal the rep. Now live at <code>/app/refill/promos</code>. <strong>Two files ported, not one</strong>: (a) new server module <code>src/server/refill-promos.ts</code> (~290 lines) containing the 3 spa-side server fns extracted from openagenticv4&rsquo;s 2851-line <code>promotions.functions.ts</code> &mdash; <code>listEligiblePromosForSpa</code>, <code>expressInterestInPromo</code>, <code>dismissPromoForSpa</code> &mdash; plus the helpers they need (<code>normalizeManufacturer</code>, <code>describeTierClauseForVerified</code>, <code>SpaInterestStatus</code>, <code>EligiblePromoForSpa</code> type, local <code>admin()</code> client). Per <em>project-refill-trojan-horse-thesis</em>, the rep-side promo management (<code>listPromotions</code>, <code>draftPromoBlast</code>, <code>sendPromoBlast</code>, <code>listPromoOutreachStates</code>, <code>routeInboundPromoReply</code>, etc. &mdash; ~2560 lines of Liz CRM stack) is intentionally NOT ported &mdash; that stays in openagenticv4. (b) <code>src/routes/app.refill.promos.tsx</code> (~480 lines) with the UI: PageHeader + summary strip + Active/All filter + promo cards with manufacturer chip, status badge (Upcoming/Active/N days left/Ended), [VERIFIED] tier-range box showing entry + top tiers from the manufacturer&rsquo;s ladder, &lsquo;I&rsquo;m interested&rsquo; / &lsquo;Not for me&rsquo; CTAs, optional 500-char rep-note message box. <strong>DB substrate already ported</strong>: <code>spa_promo_interest</code> table (20260515) + <code>knowledge_nodes</code> with <code>node_type=&lsquo;promotion&rsquo;</code> + <code>promotions_engine</code> migration (20260513050000) all already in refill-app. <strong>Cleave changes during port</strong>: removed <code>eyebrow=&ldquo;Emma(OS)&rdquo;</code> per <em>feedback-emma-never-user-facing</em> (Emma is the stealth spa-assistant codename; never appears in user-facing copy); translated all <strong>silently-broken shadcn tokens</strong> to brand tokens (<code>bg-card</code>&rarr;<code>bg-white</code>, <code>border-border</code>&rarr;<code>border-rule</code>, <code>text-foreground</code>&rarr;<code>text-ink</code>, <code>bg-muted</code>&rarr;<code>bg-rule-soft</code>, <code>bg-background</code>&rarr;<code>bg-paper</code>) per the v1.10 find that <code>--color-card</code>/<code>--color-muted</code>/<code>--color-border</code>/<code>--color-foreground</code> aren&rsquo;t defined in refill-app&rsquo;s <code>@theme</code> block; translated all <code>bg-primary</code>/<code>text-primary</code> references (which the v1.11 sweep wouldn&rsquo;t have caught because this file didn&rsquo;t exist yet) to <code>bg-emerald</code>/<code>text-emerald</code>; translated agentiport&rsquo;s <code>bg-clay</code> (expired badge) to <code>bg-rose-soft</code> and <code>bg-sage-soft</code> (active badge) to <code>bg-emerald-soft</code>. <strong>Critically NOT changed</strong>: all server-fn logic (eligibility math, manufacturer normalization, tier sorting, interest signal hydration), all UI state semantics (filter, dismiss-hide-from-active behavior, interest-noted final state), all copy beats. <strong>Cross-references</strong>: page links back to <code>/app/refill</code> dashboard from EmptyState + bottom copy; rep-side &lsquo;N practices interested&rsquo; surface lives in openagenticv4 only (Liz CRM, out of scope for refill-app). Touched: <code>src/server/refill-promos.ts</code> (new), <code>src/routes/app.refill.promos.tsx</code> (new), <code>src/lib/changelog.ts</code> (this entry).",
